!*.tfvars.example
# What a Cypress run leaves behind. Written with a leading `**/` because the
# suite lives in apps/web: a pattern containing a slash is anchored to this
# file's directory, so the bare `cypress/screenshots/` these replace matched a
# directory at the repository root that never existed, and every failing run
# offered its screenshots to the next commit.
**/cypress/videos/
**/cypress/screenshots/
**/cypress/downloads/
